+## Optional P-only FGJSQ overlay
+
+FGJSQ_CONFIG selects a shared JSON configuration; unset/disabled retains the native allocation path.
+With the overlay enabled, P-only fgjsq_v1 RPCs reserve/release through Mgmt under the workload commit lock.
+D continues worker-local CAS. The service holds independent native-P and FG-P release flags: HANDOFF
+P completion releases native workload; first nonempty D body bytes release FG load. RequestInfo private
+state survives native workload finalization. Cancel/unknown ACK is reconciled by key, and final request
+cleanup aborts residual FG reservations. Engine events carry explicit reservation identity and frozen
+progress snapshots, never sliced OpenAI IDs. The integration package owns the policy/service modules;
+seven source hook files are verified by file hashes. v1 requires native OpenAI HANDOFF, one P endpoint,
+Render/HA/hybrid fallback disabled. Mgmt restart requires drain/reconciliation.
